Provider icon alpha masks

The OpenAI and Claude masks are rasterized adaptations of Codicons by Microsoft and contributors,
as distributed in Nerd Fonts 3.5 (nf-cod-openai U+EC81 and nf-cod-claude U+EC82).
Radian rasterizes, resizes, centers, and recolors these icons for terminal graphics. No font is bundled.

Codicons source: https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-codicons
Nerd Fonts glyph mapping: https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/blob/v3.5.0/glyphnames.json
